## Close Dependabot alerts for dnspython, oauthlib, and opentelemetry-api

Context:
Open Dependabot alerts #318/#325 (oauthlib), #326/#327 (opentelemetry-api),
and #328/#329 (dnspython) reported vulnerable transitive floors in both
`uv.lock` and `src/mcp-server/uv.lock`. oauthlib 4.x was previously blocked
by databricks-sql-connector 4.4–4.6 (`oauthlib<4`); connector 4.7.0+ allows
`oauthlib>=3.1,<5`, so the floor can finally move to 4.0.1.

Changes:

