   Added covered_count_query() and a covered_count field in summary() —
   SUM(support) over _shapes. In the egocentric-signature algorithm each anchor
   has exactly one signature, so this is the distinct count of anchors that
   follow a kept pattern. Flows through latest().stats to the UI.
