the auto-saved run, and _coveragePct() blanked the KPI for any saved view. The
saved snapshot does not store the entity universe, but the just-computed run
stats (anchor_count, covered_count) are available at that moment. (2) The bar
chart axis titles were drawn as SVG <text> and were not reliably visible.

