   Coverage: _awaitDetection captures this._freshRunStats before opening the
   saved run; _showPendingSaved sets this.latest.stats from it (then clears it),
   so Coverage/Patterns reflect the run just detected. _coveragePct no longer
   hard-returns "—" for saved views — it shows the percentage whenever the
   run's anchor_count is known, else "—" (e.g. a saved run opened cold from a
